          {
            "title": "Function",
            "id": 89381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>prices</code> gibi mevcut bir listenin her öğesine <code>halve()</code> gibi bir fonksiyon uygulayarak yeni bir liste oluşturmak için liste kavrayışını kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Function 2",
            "id": 89382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kullanacağımız <code>halve()</code> fonksiyonu, bağımsız değişken olarak bir <code>num</code> sayısı alır ve <code>num/2</code> ile bunun yarısını döndürür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>num</code>, ardından <code>num/2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>halve()</code> fonksiyonunu bir <code>num</code> sayısı alıp bu sayının yarısını döndürecek şekilde tanımla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num*2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2/num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num+2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>num</code>, ardından <code>num/2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Loop",
            "id": 89383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daha önce olduğu gibi, bir <code>for</code> döngüsüyle orijinal <code>prices</code> listesindeki her <code>price</code> üzerinde yineleme yaparak başlıyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"109\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>for price in prices</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Function as an expression",
            "id": 89384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>halve()</code> gibi bir fonksiyonda her <code>price</code> değerine uygulamak istediğimiz işlemleri seçebilir ve bu fonksiyonu ifade olarak kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>halve</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>price</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>prices</code> içindeki her <code>price</code> için <code>halve()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırarak <code>halved</code> listesini oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"halved\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>halve</code>, ardından <code>price</code>, <code>price</code> ve son olarak <code>prices</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonlar, fiyatı ikiye bölmeden önce vergiyi kaldırmak gibi daha fazla ifade uygulamak istediğimizde kullanışlıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, ardından <code>no_tax/2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonlar, her liste öğesine birden fazla ifade uygulamanı sağlar.</p><p><code>halve()</code> içinde önce <code>0.85 * num</code> ile fiyatın %85'ini al, ardından bu değeri <code>2</code>'ye bölerek döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax = 0.85 + num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax*2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, ardından <code>no_tax/2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return statement",
            "id": 89671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>return</code> ifadesi içeren fonksiyonları kullanabiliriz; çünkü döndürülen değeri gerçekten yeni diziye ekliyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function as an expression",
            "id": 89665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon çağrısını ifade olarak nasıl kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyonu, her liste öğesine uygulamak için döngü değişkenini bağımsız değişken olarak kullanarak çağırırız.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonu herhangi bir bağımsız değişken olmadan çağırırız</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyonu, her liste öğesine uygulamak için döngü değişkenini bağımsız değişken olarak kullanarak çağırırız..</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonu her liste öğesine uygulamak için döngü değişkenini argüman olarak vererek fonksiyonu çağır.</p><p>Hangi liste üreteci <code>prices</code> içindeki her değer için <code>halve()</code> çağrısı yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[halve() for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[price for halve(price) in prices]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste kavrayışında ifade olarak neden bir fonksiyon kullanmamız gerekir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Üzerinde yineleme yaptığımız değerlere birden fazla ifade uygulamak için</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İfadeler her zaman fonksiyon olduğu için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Üzerinde yineleme yaptığımız değerlere birden fazla ifade uygulamak için.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İfade olarak kullanılan bir fonksiyon, liste üretecindeki her değere birden fazla hesaplama uygulayabilir.</p><p>Hangi durumda ifadede bir fonksiyon çağırmak iyi bir seçimdir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yeni listeye girmeden önce her fiyatın birkaç hesaplama adımından geçmesi gerekiyorsa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mevcut liste hiçbir değer değiştirilmeden kullanılacaksa</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yeni listeye yalnızca ilk değer kopyalanacaksa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yeni listeye girmeden önce her fiyatın birkaç hesaplama adımından geçmesi gerekiyorsa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return statement",
            "id": 89674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonu liste kapsamı içinde kullanabilir miyiz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, çünkü bir değer döndürmez</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, liste kavrayışı içinde herhangi bir fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, çünkü bir değer döndürmez.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hesaplanan tam adı yeni bir listeye koymak için fonksiyonun yalnızca yazdırmak yerine bu adı döndürmesi gerekir.</p><p>Hesaplanan adı döndürmek için <code>print(full)</code> yerine hangi satır yazılmalıdır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return full</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"full\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"Claire\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return full</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function",
            "id": 89666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Liste kavrayışının içinde, döngü değişkeni <code>name</code>'i bağımsız değişken olarak kullanarak <code>add_comma()</code> fonksiyonunu çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>add_comma</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>name</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>authors</code> içindeki her <code>name</code> için <code>add_comma()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırarak <code>authors_update</code> listesini oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"185\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"authors_update\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Ste